  ('69ce3d2a5c086d412239b442', 'nc75337442', NULL, 'M', 'About 15 minutes away, it started with a rattling shake, like a vibrating tremor that shook the whole house, sounding as if a tree was falling. It lasted a few seconds, and just when it seemed to be over, it came back even rougher and lasted longer around 10 seconds total, maybe more.', 1775123754047, NULL, 0, NULL, 1),
  ('69ce3e8b38449d3b211f3b2c', 'nc75337442', NULL, 'Anonymous', 'About the time I was supposed to pray & then sleep, all of a sudden everything I mean everything started to shake in just a space of 5-6 seconds, which includes closet doors floor, the bed the windows it''s like it felt there''s an ongoing burglary or something like a joint sting operation by law enforcement, which includes with a lot of foot (🦶👣🦶 🪜) steps stomping around which is itself is frightening & beyond undescribable most importantly please be safe out there everyone!!! (🙏👍🌆🌉✨😴💤)', 1775124107886, NULL, 0, NULL, 1),
